    description = "A start-here doc walks new authors from empty directory to running `pkspec check --strict --discover` and `pkspec lint --discover` in roughly 15 minutes. Covers the Goal / Scenario / Test mental model, the dot-path id convention, lifecycle, graph edges, decision logs, framework-internal specs, and the CI invocation."
